:: Temple_Return {"position":"2025,1200","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<<updateRouteUnlocks>>
<<set $sceneCount += 1>>
<<set $returnTo = "Temple_Return_Hub">>
<<if ($danger >= 12 and $isolation >= 10) or ($danger >= 10 and $helpRefusedCount >= 3)>>
  <<goto "CommonBadEndRouter">>
<</if>>
<<goto "EventRouter">>
<</page>>


:: Temple_Return_Hub {"position":"2025,1325","size":"100,100"}
<<page>>
<div class="narration-full">
밤이 깊어가고 있다.

낡은 처마 아래로,
찬 바람이 지나간다.
</div>

<div class="choice-box">
[[밤 정찰을 나선다->NightPatrol_Roll]]
[[잠든다->Sleep_Roll]]
[[절에 머문다->Temple]]
</div>
<</page>>

:: NightPatrol {"position":"2000,825","size":"100,100"}
